description:
Design a circuit that generates a pulse signal on the rising edge of the input clock. The output goes HIGH only for one clock cycle when the input changes from LOW to HIGH, effectively creating a rising edge detector. When the input is LOW, the output remains LOW, and it produces a HIGH pulse when the input transitions from LOW to HIGH.
module top_module(
    input wire clk_in,
    input wire in,
    output wire out
);

code:
module top_module(
    input wire clk_in,
    input wire in,
    output wire out
);reg ff;
always @(posedge clk_in)
    ff <= in;

assign out = !ff && in;

endmodule

